WEBVTT

00:08:29.877 --> 00:08:33.397
they sort of said, "Well done, Steve!"

00:08:33.397 --> 00:08:37.683
(Laughter)

00:08:37.683 --> 00:08:41.969
(Applause)

00:08:41.969 --> 00:08:46.255
You can always tell ambitious women
by the shape of our heads:

00:08:46.255 --> 00:08:49.580
They're flat on top for being 
patted patronizingly.

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:55.521
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:08:55.521 --> 00:09:00.084
And we have larger feet to stand
away from the kitchen sink.